     "type": "text",
     "text": "my road bike rear derailleur skips under load in the middle gears, mostly 4-5-6. shimano 105 11sp. chain is maybe 3000 miles. is it cable tension or something else",
     "citations": []
    }
   ],
   "sender": "human",
   "index": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-05-24T20:20:00.000000Z",
   "updated_at": "2026-05-24T20:20:00.000000Z",
   "truncated": false,
   "attachments": [],
